攝入量DRIs 2023年版》","\u003Cp\u003E📗營養讀書會：《中國居民膳食營養素參考攝入量DRIs 2023年版》\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E由中國營養學會牽頭、雲集中國疾病預防控制中心、國家食品安全風險評估中心、北京協和醫院等多家醫院，以及北京大學等多家大學的代表組成的專家組，歷時3年編著的 ✨權威營養指南⚡，助你不但吃飽吃得安全，更加 吃出健康‼️\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E⭐ DRIs核心解讀：不同年齡、性別、生理期的營養需求\u003Cbr\u003E⭐ 避雷指引：透視常見誤區，告別無效補充\u003Cbr\u003E⭐ 知行合一：善用DRIs調理飲食，逆轉慢性病患兼逆齡\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：2025年5月12日起逢星期一\u003Cbr\u003E時間：晚上8:30-9:30\u003Cbr\u003E形式：Zoom線上直播\u003Cbr\u003E費用：全免\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E❤️ 每周一小時高效學習，量身訂造你一生專屬的營養地圖❤️\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",null,"DRIs","2025-12-23T03:58:33.701Z",{"data":9},[10,16,22],{"id":11,"attributes":12},6,{"name":13,"slug":14,"description":5,"createdAt":15,"updatedAt":15},"活學營養","nutrition","2023-02-12T02:38:55.947Z",{"id":17,"attributes":18},1,{"name":19,"slug":20,"description":5,"createdAt":21,"updatedAt":21},"讀書會","book-sharing","2023-02-12T02:38:55.939Z",{"id":23,"attributes":24},8,{"name":25,"slug":26,"description":5,"createdAt":27,"updatedAt":27},"每周恆常活動","weekly_activity","2025-12-23T03:48:29.472Z",{"data":29},{"id":30,"attributes":31},88,{"name":32,"alternativeText":5,"caption":5,"width":33,"height":34,"formats":35,"hash":66,"ext":37,"mime":40,"size":67,"url":68,"previewUrl":5,"provider":69,"provider_metadata":5,"createdAt":70,"updatedAt":70},"ee41f0bc-60bc-403c-92cb-487c181f9885.JPG",1131,1600,{"large":36,"small":45,"medium":52,"thumbnail":59},{"ext":37,"url":38,"hash":39,"mime":40,"name":41,"path":5,"size":42,"width":43,"height":44},".JPG","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07.JPG","large_ee41f0bc_60bc_403c_92cb_487c181f9885_4f9aa24e07","image\u002Fjpeg","large_ee41f0bc-60bc-403c-92cb-487c181f9885.JPG",100.83,707,1000,{"ext":37,"url":46,"hash":47,"mime":40,"name":48,"path":5,"size":49,"width":50,"heigh